      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    starting_index_value = 121.0\n    starting_prices = [15.0, 20.0, 30.0]\n    ending_prices = [20.0, 30.0, 25.0]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    percentage_changes = [\n        (ending_price - starting_price) / starting_price\n        for starting_price, ending_price in zip(starting_prices, ending_prices)\n    ]\n    average_percentage_change = sum(percentage_changes) / len(percentage_changes)\n    answer = starting_index_value * (1 + average_percentage_change)\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(answer, 3)\n```",
